# lexicon.default.pdl - what the pet knows at birth (copied to its state as lexicon.pdl). LEX | phrase | verb | item | weight (0..10).
# A new pet knows only "hi" and "food". Everything else it learns from the master (teach), and weights move with praise and scolding.
LEX | hi    | hello |       | 5
LEX | food  | feed  | apple | 3
